					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690323,
					"content": "唔，还是对比一下效果比较好…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690324,
					"content": "请你帮我把这些花分别放在雪山上的<color=#00E1FFFF>七天神像附近</color>、<color=#00E1FFFF>雪山里一个洞窟的入口</color>。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690325,
					"content": "然后再<color=#00E1FFFF>在雪山里找到一片水域</color>…不管是湖还是池塘都可以，然后把一盒花放在水边吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690326,
					"content": "这次请您千万小心一些，千万别把它们弄坏了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690321,
					"content": "要埋在哪里？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200690311,
					"content": "当天卖完就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 200690312,
					"content": "这样当然最好啦，但每天总归会有那么一两枝没人买的花。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 200690313,
					"content": "虽然只有这么一两枝，但我也不想让它们就这样白白枯萎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200690314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				}
			]
		},
